     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ManageStakeholders</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.ManageStakeholders\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ManageStakeholders\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ProgrammeManager.html\">Programme Manager</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"STAKEHOLDER-01\"> </a></b>Define RASCI matrix</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can define and maintain a RASCI (Responsible, Accountable, Support, Consulted, Informed) matrix for all DAK activities.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"STAKEHOLDER-02\"> </a></b>Engage guideline stewards</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can ensure that authors of source documents and subject matter experts are actively engaged in collaborative DAK development.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"STAKEHOLDER-03\"> </a></b>Plan SME consultations</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can define meeting cadence and format for SME consultations, including workshops, in-person country visits, and online sessions.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"STAKEHOLDER-04\"> </a></b>Prepare consultation materials</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can create agendas, question lists, and visual aids for SME consultation meetings.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"STAKEHOLDER-05\"> </a></b>Coordinate cross-programme collaboration</td><td>SHOULD</td><td><div><p>Can identify and coordinate with other health programmes for overlapping components such as shared indicators or data items.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ManageStakeholders</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.ManageStakeholders\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ManageStakeholders\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent à l'acteur <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ProgrammeManager.html\">Programme Manager</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-STAKEHOLDER-01\"> </a></b>Define RASCI matrix</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can define and maintain a RASCI (Responsible, Accountable, Support, Consulted, Informed) matrix for all DAK activities.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-STAKEHOLDER-02\"> </a></b>Engage guideline stewards</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can ensure that authors of source documents and subject matter experts are actively engaged in collaborative DAK development.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-STAKEHOLDER-03\"> </a></b>Plan SME consultations</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can define meeting cadence and format for SME consultations, including workshops, in-person country visits, and online sessions.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-STAKEHOLDER-04\"> </a></b>Prepare consultation materials</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can create agendas, question lists, and visual aids for SME consultation meetings.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-STAKEHOLDER-05\"> </a></b>Coordinate cross-programme collaboration</td><td>SHOULD</td><td><div><p>Can identify and coordinate with other health programmes for overlapping component